# FastFree Clan — Overview

## What is FastFree Clan?
FastFree Clan is a module of the FastFree ERP providing Clan (Nix-based) infrastructure management.

## Architecture
- Backend (Dart): generates clan/*.yaml, nix.yaml, flake.nix using nix package
- Stac SDUI (Flutter): renders UI from JSON via Stac.fromNetwork with fallback assets

## Packages
- fastfree_clan (core)
- fastfree_layout, fastfree_hr, fastfree_splash (dependents)

